# ⚠️ Critical Rules

DO NOT ❌

* Trust client price
* Skip signature validation
* Skip idempotency
* Ignore webhook retries
* Skip saving raw webhook data
* Directly activate subscription (use event)

DO ✅

* Always verify provider signature
* Always use DB price
* Store full payment history
* Publish event via outbox pattern
* Handle duplicate webhook calls safely

